{
  "about": "Camera bookmarks for tests/shots.mjs. Each one loads dist/voidborne.debug.html?det=1&manual=1#seed=<seed>&q=<quality>, freezes the frame loop, optionally sets the clock ('time', s), places the camera with __VB.place(place) (see src/debug/vb-api.js), runs 1 frame, waits for streaming, runs frames-2 more frames and captures the canvas. 'dir' is the direction from the subject to the camera (\"sun\" = its lit side); 'dist' is in radii of the subject unless the place says metres. Phase 6B: '-ultra' bookmarks repeat a '-high' (or '-medium') view with the ultra preset for side-by-side comparison; hull-close and planet-close come in a high/ultra pair. Phase 6C: star-class and multiple-star views ('starclass' / 'sysplanet' places, see src/debug/vb-api.js); a bookmark's own 'cfg' is added to the URL as ?cfg= (home-variety turns on CFG.HOME_STAR_VARIETY). Phase 6E: 'e6-' bookmarks show the new deep-space content of seed 1337 (nearest comet, outer belt, ship graveyard and an enterable hull, the broken ancient ring and its monolith, a supernova remnant from outside, inside and at low quality, a planetary nebula); place {at:'e6', what} finds the nearest one.",
